'''Malignant Madness''' is a [[debuff]] that reduces the [[action speed]] and [[damage]] of affected targets. It is applied by the monster [[Tentacle Fiend]] or applied by the player by using [[Impresence]] or [[The Eternal Struggle]] or {{il|Eldritch Blasphemy Support}}.

The debuff reduce affected targets' [[action speed]] and [[damage]] by 10%.

==Sources==
* [[File:Maddening Presence status icon.png|25px|link=Maddening Presence]] [[Maddening Presence]], a buff granted by the item Impresence
* [[Tentacle Fiend]], a kind of monster in Elder-influenced map
* {{il|The Eternal Struggle}}, Critical Strikes inflict Malignant Madness if The Eater of Worlds is dominant
* {{il|Eldritch Blasphemy Support}}

==See also==
* [[Eldritch decay (ground effect)|Eldritch decay]], another debuff that can appear in Elder-influenced map
